OL,3,GNEWSAGolf equipment worth #100,000
OL,4,Astolen from club
OL,5,
OL,6,FGolf equipment believed to be worth
OL,7,Fmore than #100,000 has been stolen from
OL,8,Fa club.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to reports of a burglary at St
OL,12,FIves Golf Club on Needingworth Road
OL,13,Fjust after 22:30 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FA gate and glass doors were smashed,
OL,16,Fpolice said.
OL,18,FThe force has appealed for anyone who
OL,19,Fsaw a Land Rover in the area before the
OL,20,Ftheft or anyone with information or
OL,21,Fvideo footage to get in touch.
